## SPF / DKIM / DMARC findings

### SPF

{{ spf_md }}

The SPF RFC 7208 specifies a 10-DNS-lookup budget. Counts above that are
flagged. `+all` is treated as too permissive. Missing `all` is flagged.

### DKIM

{{ dkim_md }}

RSA keys shorter than 1024 bits are a warning; shorter than 2048 bits are
advisory.

### DMARC aggregate

{{ dmarc_md }}

Do not move to `p=reject` until the aggregate pass rate is at least 99% for
30 days. Premature reject drops legitimate mail.

